Request for pre-PTO backfeed: Halbray Field Solar Site 3, PXA-2024-0002,
feeder ALN-159
Under the pre-PTO backfeed term of our executed Interconnection Service Agreement
(ISA-Halbray-Field-Site-3), Halbray Community Solar LP requests that Alleniom energize the site's step-up
transformer and its ac collection system from feeder ALN-159 on 07/29/2025, so that our contractor can run the
inverters' pre-start checks on utility power. The inverters stay disabled throughout the backfeed and will not
operate in parallel before permission to operate.
Construction was completed on 07/03/2025. The Kelloway Township final electrical inspection under permit
EP-25-0418 is booked for 07/24/2025.
Please confirm the date, or tell us what stands in the way.
